    {
      "id": "2123302776142799148",
      "text": "🎥: https://t.co/EuSlyJfjRf Luka Doncic admitted he needed to play better and lead his team better in the Lakers’ loss to the Jazz.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123302776142799148",
      "published": "2026-11-19T06:30:05+00:00",
      "likes": 22,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
