      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123296123674911016",
      "text": "Luka Doncic called this an \"unacceptable\" performance from him and says he needs to lead the team better.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123296123674911016",
      "published": "2026-11-19T06:03:39+00:00",
      "likes": 913,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123295762994122986",
      "text": "Luka Doncic says fatigue can't be an excuse and that he needed to play better.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123295762994122986",
      "published": "2026-11-19T06:02:13+00:00",
      "likes": 334,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123292973085626755",
      "text": "Walker Kessler felt tonight's loss was more about poor shot-making than lack of effort for the Lakers. \"We were playing hard. I think Vando got like three offensive rebounds on one possession. We got like five shots [on that possession] and just none of them fell.\"",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123292973085626755",
      "published": "2026-11-19T05:51:08+00:00",
      "likes": 558,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123292204856902011",
      "text": "Walker Kessler: \"It was a tough night for me... My touch was not what it should be tonight. From the free throw line, obviously, and from the field. But you gotta figure it out and move on.\"",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123292204856902011",
      "published": "2026-11-19T05:48:05+00:00",
      "likes": 345,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123291942197002427",
      "text": "Walker Kessler: \"It's frustrating. Tonight wasn't our night. But I think our team is gonna respond well to this loss.\"",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123291942197002427",
      "published": "2026-11-19T05:47:02+00:00",
      "likes": 306,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123291463840874507",
      "text": "JJ Redick admitted that Luka Doncic's workload without Austin Reaves in the lineup is \"taking a toll\" and has led to back-to-back inefficient nights.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123291463840874507",
