    },
    {
      "id": "2123284645257376016",
      "text": "The challenge was unsuccessful. The ball went off Kessler, so not even sure if they were able to look at the potential foul on Luka.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123284645257376016",
      "published": "2026-11-19T05:18:02+00:00",
      "likes": 33,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Luka thought he was fouled on that drive and JJ Redick will challenge the out of bounds call.",
      "quoted_author": "Lakers Nation",
      "quoted_handle": "LakersNation"
    },
    {
      "id": "2123281796075069520",
      "text": "He didn't dunk that one, but we will take the layup. Tie game",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123281796075069520",
      "published": "2026-11-19T05:06:43+00:00",
      "likes": 47,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "I know he's getting fouled, but would love it if Kessler could go up strong and finish some of these buckets inside.",
      "quoted_author": "Lakers Nation",
      "quoted_handle": "LakersNation"
    },
