    },
    {
      "id": "2123278653400506460",
      "text": "With his third steal tonight vs. Utah, Matisse Thybulle has recorded 3+ steals in seven consecutive games, the longest such streak of his career. Thybulle joins Eddie Jones (1996) as the only Lakers to record seven consecutive games with 3+ steals since the NBA/ABA merger",
